  "reading": "O and the transformer order agents in the SAME direction, significantly (AUC 0.717, Mann-Whitney p=1.4e-34), but they are far from redundant. Non-redundancy is partly protective: an O that reproduced the classifier would reintroduce the circularity of measuring evasion of a detector with that detector's own score. What this CANNOT establish is that the classifier's score also FALLS after blocks - the export is full-period and covers the wrong population, so the post-block behavior of b stays untested."
